      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Trampling Charge",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "flourish"
      ],
      "text": "Molog urges Bloodwing forward, trampling enemies in their path. He commands her to Stride or Fly up to her Speed, moving through the spaces of any foes in his path up to Large size. Bloodwing deals damage equal to her claw melee Strike to each creature whose space they move through, subject to a DC 31 basic Reflex save save. On a critical failure, the creature also becomes Off-Guard until the end of Molog's next turn. He can damage a given creature only once during this movement."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Weapon Adept",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Moloch can Swap between his glaive and composite shortbow, then Strike with the weapon he switched to."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Wyvern's Swoop",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "flourish"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements Molog is mounting his wyvern\n\n---\nEffect Molog Commands his mount to Stride twice. At any point during this movement, he can Strike one enemy within reach or within the first range increment of his ranged weapon, with a +1 circumstance bonus to his attack roll. If he began this movement at a higher point than his target, he deals an additional die of damage with this Strike.",
